{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "19cc454d-9452-8437-8764-c02ee54b73eb",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T11:53:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Correia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:50:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:50:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. Um, I think I'm calling about a water and sewer bill. It's for 106 Broadway, in the North End. I manage the property, sort of for the owner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:50:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. What's going on with the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:50:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I think it came in maybe higher than usual. Like, probably double what it normally is. And I had a plumber out there recently, I think about three weeks ago, and he fixed a leak. I kept the receipt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:50:41-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, hang onto that. When there's a leak, the meter keeps counting all the water that went through, so a high reading after a leak is pretty common. Do you know if the plumber repaired it, like replaced a pipe or a toilet part?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:50:57-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think it was a toilet thing, maybe the flapper? Sort of running all the time. The receipt says repair of running toilet, I think. Sorry, I'm, uh, in a salon chair right now, between a client's color and the rinse, so I've got like a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:51:14-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, we'll be quick. So what I'd do is send us a copy of that receipt along with the bill, and the office can look at the readings and see if there's anything they can do. I can't promise an adjustment, but that's the first step."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:51:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I, like, email it? Or maybe bring it in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:51:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either one works. I can give you the billing office email, or you can drop it at the counter at City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:51:44-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I think I'd rather bring it in. Actually, one other thing. The tenant in the first floor, she's a senior, I think maybe seventy-something. Is there any discount for low-income or elderly households? On the water bill, I mean."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:51:59-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have a program I can point you to for the water and sewer bills off the top of my head. I'll make a note and have someone from billing call you back about it. Is this the best number, the one you're on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:52:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I think it's 401-555-0199. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:52:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0199. I'll put that in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:52:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And, um, last question, sorry. Can the bill be paid on a Saturday or Sunday? Because I think I'm usually only free on weekends, maybe. Is there some online way, or a drop box, or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:52:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you can pay online any time, weekends included, and there's also a payment drop box outside City Hall that's available when the office is closed. The counter itself is only open weekdays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:52:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so online on the weekend, or the drop box. That should work, I think. Do I need the account number for the online one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:52:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's on the top of your bill. Have that handy and you're set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:53:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Sorry, I think she's calling me, the rinse is ready. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:53:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, Luis. Somebody will call you about the discount question. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:53:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
